        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-04-required-interaction-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Respond to the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-04-required-interaction-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Two versions of the plan · 1: A partner proposes acting immediately on the first part of this account. Explain the later information they need, ask one clarification, and negotiate a suitable next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "我和朋友准备下午看一个中文电影。刚才我打开电脑，等了半天，电脑还没有开机。我以为电脑坏了，朋友让我再等一会儿。\n\n电脑没有开机，我有点儿不想等了。朋友说他家有电脑，可以去他家看。我不想再等，就把书和衣服放进书包，准备和他一起出门。\n\n出门前，电脑开机了。刚才是在等它开始工作，不是电脑真的坏了。我说：“我们不用去你家了。先坐好，再一起看电影吧。”朋友坐回椅子上。\n\n我们看完电影，朋友说：“刚才觉得等了很长时间，其实没有半天，是几分钟。”我也笑了。有时候说半天是觉得等了很长时间，不是真的半个白天。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My reply uses the later information instead of simply repeating the first claim."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "My clarification and proposed next step address the practical constraint."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
